Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.35,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Elias's paper had his obituary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:05.07,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It arrived a day\Nearly: his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:07.51,Midnight,,0,0,0,,his apartment, a fire at 3:07.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.03,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:11.20,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He had no subscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:14.52,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Underneath, in small\Nprint: one name per
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:18.22,Midnight,,0,0,0,,fire. At 2:40,\NElias knocked on 4A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.82,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Mara's heater had been\Nsparking all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.44,Midnight,,0,0,0,,She'd asked him to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.06,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He told her to call the super.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:26.08,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He took the stairs\Nand didn't look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:28.40,Midnight,,0,0,0,,back. From the\Nhotel, he watched the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:29.24,Midnight,,0,0,0,,smoke rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.02,Midnight,,0,0,0,,At 3:07, 4B burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.65,0:00:34.16,Midnight,,0,0,0,,The next paper\Nwaited at the front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:36.03,Midnight,,0,0,0,,desk. Same fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:37.08,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Same hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:38.02,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Different name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:40.18,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Mara Kwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.18,0:00:41.44,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Apartment 4A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:43.52,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It said she'd entered 4B to warn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:46.18,Midnight,,0,0,0,,him. Elias laid the\Ntwo obituaries side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.14,Midnight,,0,0,0,,by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:48.12,Midnight,,0,0,0,,His name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:51.97,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Mara's. The paper wasn't\Npredicting the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:54.37,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It was choosing who paid for it.
